      "description": "Protect Data With Beyond DLP (Data Loss Prevention) | ITsMine Skip to content Get The Latest Ebook: Encryption-less Ransomware: Best Practices for CISOs to Ensure Protection : Download Now Platform Resources Cool Vendor Blogs Exclusive content CISOs: Protecting Only Half Your Organization? ITsMine Ransomware SOS Guidebook Company About Careers News Solutions Encryption-less Ransomware Managed Data Protection (MDP) Virtual Vaults CrowdStrike Integration Contact Us Platform Resources Cool Vendor Blogs Exclusive content CISOs: Protecting Only Half Your Organization? ITsMine Ransomware SOS Guidebook Company About Careers News Solutions Encryption-less Ransomware Managed Data Protection (MDP) Virtual Vaults CrowdStrike Integration Contact Us Start Now Log In Start Now Log In Platform Resources Cool Vendor Blogs Exclusive content CISOs: Protecting Only Half Your Organization? ITsMine Ransomware SOS Guidebook Company About Careers News Solutions Encryption-less Ransomware Managed Data Protection (MDP) Virtual Vaults CrowdStrike Integration Contact Us Platform Resources Cool Vendor Blogs Exclusive content CISOs: Protecting Only Half Your Organization? ITsMine Ransomware SOS Guidebook Company About Careers News Solutions Encryption-less Ransomware Managed Data Protection (MDP) Virtual Vaults CrowdStrike Integration Contact Us ITsMine Named a Gartner Cool Vendor in Data Security Start Now We are incredibly honored to announce that ITsMine, the leading data loss and leakage prevention company, has been recognized by Gartner as a Cool Vendor, based on the August 9th, 2023, report titled “Cool Vendors in Data Security” by Mike Huskey and Andrew Bales. Besides being recognized as a significant (and cool!) vendor in the data security space, we firmly believe that our nomination in this Cool Vendor report by Gartner emphasizes the significance of our mission to empower Security and Risk Management (SRM) professionals with the tools they need to protect the organizational data. With our Agentless Beyond DLP Platform, we deliver the answer to the new generation of Ransomware attacks (Lockbit, AlpHV, CLOP), involving data leakage followed by encryption. This recognition also showcases the amazing capabilities of our superstar team, as well as our amazing Customers who want to go beyond traditional DLP and protect their organizations’ sensitive data from ransomware attacks, breaches, and internal data threats even beyond company boundaries. So why is ITsMine so cool? Gartner’s Cool Vendor research is “designed to highlight interesting, new and innovative vendors, products and services.” The research by Gartner notes that: “ITsMine Agentless Beyond DLP (data loss prevention) is an agentless data protection platform that simplifies both traditional DLP by replacing traditional policy-based enforcement models with a dynamic and intuitive combination of digital rights management (EDRM) and AI driven threat detection. It provides threat detection to protect sensitive data from breaches, ransomware attacks, and malicious or careless insiders.” “ITsMine gives control of data by converting folders in your data repositories into a ‘VirtualVault,’ which serves as the mechanism by which ITsMine allows you to audit, track, and manage your data, even beyond your corporate boundaries. Facilitated by Microsoft MIP, the files within your vaults are equipped with what ITsMine has termed ‘File GPS,’ which provides visibility and control of your data across multiple storage applications, regardless of location.” “ITsMine protects data by utilizing AI to strategically deploy live decoy files (SoftwareMines)that are designed to mimic sensitive data in your storage repositories. These files act as beacons that ‘detonate’ and alert you whenever there is an unexpected attempt to access, encrypt, or exfiltrate a folder containing a SoftwareMine file.” “Remediation actions are differentiated based on whether the attempt originated from a managed or unmanaged device and can be further tuned per exfiltration vector to reduce false positive events, thus alleviating the burden of ‘alert fatigue’ often associated with traditional DLP tools.״ What it’s all about​ We’re on a mission to combat the latest ransomware threats, like Lockbit, AlpHV, CLOP. Our platform goes beyond detection, actively identifying leaked files before they’re encrypted, and issues a Real Time alert that a file was opened and accessed outside company boundaries. It provides crucial insights to SRM including the full list of leaked files, and gives them the power to eliminate these compromised files, even once the attacker has hold of them. I TsMine is Agentless and very easy to implement (less than a day), does not require additional headcount due to AI and deception techniques used, has built in automatic reaction for both Internal and External threats and can turn any folder into the most secured folder, whether on premise or in the cloud. So why should SRM leaders and MSSPs care? Gartner emphasizes the benefits that ITsMine’s solution brings to Security and Risk Management Leaders as well as to MSSPs who provides Security Services: “SRM leaders looking for a more proactive approach to DLP that produces less false positives than traditional policy-based enforcement strategies.”​ “SRM leaders tasked with implementing a DLP solution that adapts to a remote workforce. ITsMine DLP can provide consistent data loss protection across multiple storage applications.” “MSSPs looking to provide clients with a lightweight, agentless DLP solution that meets regulatory requirements for data protection on managed and unmanaged devices.” “SRM professionals that wish to audit, track, and manage files beyond their corporate boundaries.” Protect yourself To find out more about the solution and how it could seamlessly fit into your environment, and ensure you’re prepared for the new generation of Ransomware attacks (Lockbit, AlpHV, CLOP), involving data leakage followed by encryption",
